      "title": "Welcome!",
      "description": [
        "# {lang:showcase.greeting}",
        "This book shows off **everything Trailmark can do**. Every chapter is a real quest line you can play.",
        "",
        "![Trailmark](media/banner.png){width=220}",
        "",
        "## Text",
        "**Bold**, *italic*, __underlined__, ~~struck~~, `code`, a ||spoiler|| and &aclassic &bcolour &dcodes&r, even &#FF9A3Chex colours&r.",
        "",
        "> Quotes look like this.",
        "",
        "- Lists",
        "  - nest by indenting",
        "1. and can be numbered",
        "",
        "| Key | Does |",
        "|---|---|",
        "| <kbd>I</kbd> | Opens this book |",
        "| <kbd>'</kbd> | Shows or hides the tracker |",
        "| <kbd>T</kbd> | Tracks the selected quest |",
        "",
        "## Things in text",
        "Hover an item, then press <kbd>R</kbd> or <kbd>U</kbd> for recipes: <item id=\"minecraft:crafting_table\"/> <item id=\"minecraft:iron_pickaxe\"/> <item id=\"minecraft:bread\" count=\"16\"/>",
        "",
        "<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px\"><entity type=\"minecraft:camel\" animation=\"walk\" yaw=\"40\" size=\"48\"/><block id=\"minecraft:blast_furnace[lit=true]\" size=\"40\"/><player name=\"@self\" mainhand=\"minecraft:diamond_sword\" pose='{\"right_arm\": [-110, 0, 0]}' size=\"48\"/></div>",
        "",
        "<details><summary>Click to open a hidden section</summary>Details sections keep long explanations tidy.</details>",
        "",
        "<div class=\"callout\">The pack's style.css styles this call-out. Links work too: [the next quest](quest:pack:welcome/tracking) or [the First Steps chapter](chapter:pack:first_steps).</div>",
        "",
        "&7&o- {lang:showcase.signature}"
      ]
    },
